Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.74,0:00:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.04,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.98,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.74,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.14,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\Nin the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up\Nour thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones\Nwe love, we'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The bonds built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know, that's\Nwhat we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.88,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.35,0:02:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.70,0:02:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers, yes, we're the Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers, yes, we're the Superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.20,0:02:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Elvin's angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.74,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, even angrier than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone to the port!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find no mercy at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nor on land!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here and face us, Betty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So you chose to fight me, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.10,0:03:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.96,0:03:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting executed either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.20,0:03:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't disembark now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those ships are blocking the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Haul air!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight into that port!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second—why\Nis veggie speeding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.14,0:03:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna crash into the shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,shore
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.74,0:03:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't he supposed to be\Nslowing down right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's\Nholding a suicide attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pushing up on the cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Bungie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire as soon as they disembark!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the filthy traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.04,0:04:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, you bunch of schmucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.98,0:04:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It would seem you don't\Nknow about my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,De Nostra Costello is an amphibious craft!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle's turned into tank treads.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody told me they could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.62,0:04:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Always good to have a\Ntrick up your sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.68,0:04:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I reveal my hand to you chums?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are my enemies, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate this asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Siobhan, let us take\Nthat cake off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too big to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.32,0:05:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, we're going a little\Nfast, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but I think we're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I wasn't ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Make room on the deck and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.76,0:05:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.46,0:06:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold this, hurry back up, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta make room on the deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go now, lay it on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's lifting the card\Nwith one leg—is he a chef?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,right, here we go,\Neveryone—prepare for impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,for impact
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn dude, nice moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, it smells good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.66,0:07:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.24,0:07:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.80,0:07:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I made it here just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But honey, that was reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.10,0:07:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.68,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Pudding, stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting through me, be careful\Nplease, Oven Sir, get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you fools\Nthink you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can stop this ship easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.10,0:08:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice whistle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, don't you worry, Pez.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That bad man won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Who in the world is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A stalker?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so happy, pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a wonderful family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.56,0:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail towards the southeast, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.52,0:08:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll steamroll through town and\Nmake a turn towards the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Puddin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.88,0:09:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about this, but\Nwe're hitting some houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's what it\Ntakes, then go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to see it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.94,0:09:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make them good\Nas new once we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Houses can always be rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.88,0:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And families, too. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I'd rather they not\Nbreak down in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But my new home won't break easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.04,0:09:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The strength of my new\Nfamily attests to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.30,0:09:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, shucks, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.64,0:10:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use the cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You might hit the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.92,0:10:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All darts, head to the\Nsoutheast coastline!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,On our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.32,0:10:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrivederci, Cacao Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a hoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,those suckers ain't nobody catching\Nup to this ship now you saved
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,my life back there thanks Beach i\Ndidn't do it for your sake dingbat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is your ship so hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.98,0:11:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, sea's looking kind of funky, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.36,0:11:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's dead fish floating up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting boiled alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, add some salt,\Nand I bet they taste great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.94,0:11:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting boiled next.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only one guy could pull a stunt like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.96,0:11:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tropical torment!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.66,0:11:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd allow\Nyou traitors to sail away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With my DD powers, I'll\Nboil every one of you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.74,0:11:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.16,0:11:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What an awful way to go, little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.80,0:11:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lives aren't the\Nonly thing at risk here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.04,0:11:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The fresh chocolate can't get too hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The whipped cream's in\Ndanger of melting, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We need the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:12:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we survive the heat,\Nwe're as good as dead without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna end up paying\Nfor this, too, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna give those boiled fish\Nto Big Mom instead of her cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.68,0:12:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What just blew up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The paddles broke down in the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard, he's gonna send\Nus straight to hell alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.15,0:12:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven, did you forget that we're trying\Nto save the country with this cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.42,0:12:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy or sad? Silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.60,0:12:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Abbott, I'll get it off behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it off you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.92,0:13:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Olven!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that guy? A friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Olven's enemy at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.30,0:13:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're a one-top cookie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Another betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm your stepson, and you would kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, looks like the\Nwater is cooling down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Retract the battles for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.90,0:14:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sail the hell out\Nof this heat right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed up this ship if you can! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.66,0:14:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet grandchild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're happy, and your\Nparents take extra good care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd been able\Nto do that for my kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lin-Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Our children!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Chiffon and Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A pair of twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hold them, can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You've served your purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Linlin! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.84,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you want me to leave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.24,0:15:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm their father, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be a family!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You really must think highly of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.14,0:15:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ardlan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.72,0:15:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're my children!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me hold them even just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.76,0:15:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why\Nyou're doing this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ardlan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ardlan! Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they were with my girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 26 years since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chiffon, I'm so happy\Nto see your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.14,0:16:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you've gotten\Nyourself in a sticky situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But you look happy, and that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.52,0:16:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pears, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's real hot,\Nbut we're almost through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise we'll always keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.26,0:16:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're going to turn into a\Nhuge disappointment, just like Lola.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good for a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would I ever\Nneed two of you fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Children who don't serve a\Npurpose should leave my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.94,0:17:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see your\Nstupid face anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me, Shabon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Pez.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mama and papa are always\Ngoing to be here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been worried about you for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've had your\Nshare of tough times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.32,0:17:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And your share of lonely times, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.14,0:17:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry that I couldn't be there\Nfor you when you needed me the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know it's late, but\Nnow I can finally tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the clear, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's leave him in the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake just barely made it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to decorate this cake. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you got rid of me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where's my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.14,0:18:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.26,0:18:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's back! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Last time was a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd die in a real fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom aside, we're outnumbered badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.46,0:18:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If we stop, we're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,First in line, baby! Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.16,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to wreck those losers so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, who's our enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.04,0:19:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.24,0:19:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not seeing any Straw\NHats on that ship, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.26,0:19:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, where did the Straw Hats go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.20,0:19:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, but you gotta hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard her. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.68,0:19:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think I'm gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.72,0:19:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.22,0:19:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of thinking\Ncannonballs if they're all stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd they turn like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know, when Mama's not in her\Nright mind, they get kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.32,0:19:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.15,0:19:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.94,0:19:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Baba Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't explode, I'm gonna explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going at full speed here,\Nand Mama hasn't slowed down either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we catch these pumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably because they have Jinbei\Nand he knows the sea so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bugawa, sir, we just got a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.84,0:20:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Big trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you see, Carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a whole bunch of ships ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,An ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can almost taste that wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.32,0:21:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you looking to burn\Nyourself out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would have blamed\Nyou if you ran away,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,not with me as your opponent—you\Nhad the perfect chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.34,0:21:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you would sooner choose death\Nthan live with the shame of running?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.34,0:21:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,running
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You said I'm gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.94,0:21:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, knowing that you cannot defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.56,0:21:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you've come to beg that\Nwe accept you as an
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,ally hoping to save\Nyour friends from death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.42,0:21:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not begging!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.38,0:21:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You still think you can win?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made it quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.96,0:22:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.93,0:22:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I feared we'd encounter more\Nenemies sooner or later,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd hope that we'd lose Big Mom first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Baba-wa, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.08,0:22:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A fleet led by Minister Daifugo has\Narrived right in front of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We have reinforcements from\Nbehind, too. Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet General Smoothie is pulling\Nin with an entire fleet of ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.22,0:22:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even better,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.28,0:22:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,it seems that she is lady citron and\Nlady cinnamon on her flagship as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.66,0:23:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're unstoppable now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's toast—kind of overkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Better an easy victory than\Na narrow one. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.40,0:23:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.72,0:23:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here, pearls?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.06,0:23:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got mama with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.94,0:23:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you sunk these rats already?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.46,0:23:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I take them out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.48,0:23:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you lickety like.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.48,0:23:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.54,0:23:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,had more than enough action.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.76,0:23:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.67,0:23:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to cacao island pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Should be waiting for mama\Nthere with wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like mama's getting\Na bit lickety skinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.86,0:23:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,will have my damn cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.84,0:23:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,ships, prepare to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.22,0:23:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,soon as the Straw Hats come within\Nrange, obliterate the punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.16,0:23:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,punks
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.36,0:24:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Daifugo ships are getting\Nready to shoot their cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.82,0:24:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're in their firing\Nrange, not for the time being at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.46,0:24:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet we have no choice but to advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The other enemies will\Nblock us on every side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.04,0:24:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then we might\Nas well confront them directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.96,0:24:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain our current speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.44,0:24:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I warn you, Daifugo is quite formidable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be very careful\Nwhen contending with his genie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We must reunite with Sanji at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.40,0:24:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We will rise to the occasion somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.02,0:24:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.93,0:24:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's prepare for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take a rumble ball, then\NI can do some real damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.60,0:24:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull in close, then I'll jump\Nonto their ship and go berserk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.00,0:24:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.36,0:24:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The close range is our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.62,0:24:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.78,0:24:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna try to close the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.92,0:24:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire every shell to make\Nsure they never reach us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.80,0:24:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna start some chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.28,0:25:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's use the normal\Ncannonballs, okay? No more!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.44,0:25:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.52,0:25:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopra!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.32,0:25:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.50,0:25:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.46,0:25:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me fight them!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.08,0:25:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is finally my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.42,0:25:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.46,0:25:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.18,0:25:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a full moon tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.68,0:25:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're turning too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.28,0:25:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been trained to do that properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.46,0:25:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.48,0:25:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro taught me all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.18,0:25:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If he were here, I know what he'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.30,0:25:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna fight those\Nguys, then I will too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle it, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.24,0:25:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm a musketeer, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're almost here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.72,0:26:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire salvos and we'll\Nsink them in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, wait for my cue!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.66,0:26:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Pedro?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.56,0:26:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,One day, Yugara will understand\Nthe decision that I've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.74,0:26:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Know it was to keep Luffy and his crew\Nalive so they can continue onward.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.78,0:26:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep fighting on your behalf, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that line?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.54,0:27:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Her eyes turn bright red.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.62,0:27:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like her at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.60,0:27:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.10,0:28:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite mesmerizing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.68,0:28:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such a thing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.30,0:28:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could only see her panties as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.32,0:28:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, so this is what Duke\Ndog storm was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.36,0:28:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We underestimated the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.04,0:28:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack alone was too much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.68,0:28:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It only took one of Kaido's\Ntroops to leave us in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.64,0:28:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall not make the same mistake next\Ntime, from now on we'll be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.32,0:28:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They shall soon realize they have\Nyet to see our full potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.84,0:28:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,as we still have one\Nfinal ace up our sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.04,0:28:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have guessed what he meant at\Nthe time, but this would certainly qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The true power of the Minx.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.04,0:28:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So the full moon did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.86,0:29:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that what I think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.90,0:29:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got bad news, Minister Daifugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.14,0:29:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a full moon tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Straw Hats have a meet with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.24,0:29:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She went so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.64,0:29:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All troops prepare for\Na close quarters battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.88,0:29:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be from the phantom island,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,like Pedro might be just as deadly in\Nthis state, probably? Probably more so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.58,0:29:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna fall in the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.86,0:29:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.02,0:29:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she skimming on the\Nsurface of the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.02,0:29:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.80,0:29:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your surprise for what comes next.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.76,0:29:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.10,0:29:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:29:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.40,0:29:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a warrior from Zou.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.76,0:29:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.18,0:30:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this. Check me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.58,0:30:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.68,0:30:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep firing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.38,0:30:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.62,0:30:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.76,0:30:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.76,0:31:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.16,0:31:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,At least tell me what's going on, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.32,0:31:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you little rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.36,0:31:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can take down\Nthe whole fleet like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Might take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.84,0:31:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're busy, there's nothing\Nstopping us from sinking your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.14,0:31:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you calm down and...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.10,0:31:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.20,0:31:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.72,0:31:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She broke the steering\Nwheel right off! I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.10,0:31:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship is turning on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.52,0:31:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're a\Nclever rabbit, don't ya?
